========================================================================
D. Every byte that MENTIONS NOTWIN, and what it rules
========================================================================
  bytes with NOTWIN set: 128
  their rulings: {'RESHAPE': 17, 'ADD_STATE': 64, 'ADD_MATERIAL': 32, 'AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR': 15}
  -> RESHAPE requires NOTWIN, but NOTWIN does not imply RESHAPE:
     AMB and UNREAD outrank it (lowest set bit among bits 1..6 wins).

